<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</view><view class="title">每一步，都有着落。</view><view class="muted">这里显示本机保存的询单。换手机后，可通过私人查询码重新添加；查询码请勿公开分享。</view><view class="label">添加已有询单</view><input value="{{input}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="64" placeholder="粘贴完整私人查询码"/><button class="button" bindtap="add" disabled="{{loading}}">添加并查看</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在更新询单…</view><view wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !saved.length}}" class="notice">还没有保存的询单。提交拍摄计划后，就能在这里查看进展。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{saved}}" wx:key="token"><block wx:if="{{item.order}}"><view class="eyebrow">{{item.order.id}}</view><view class="card-title">{{item.label}}</view><view>{{item.date}} · Brisbane 时间</view><view class="muted">报价：{{item.order.quote_amount==null?'待确认':'A$'+item.order.quote_amount}}</view><view class="muted">已记录定金：A${{item.order.deposit_paid||0}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.order.film}}" class="muted">已选择真实 35mm 胶片</view></block><view wx:else class="error">{{item.error}}</view><view class="row"><text class="small-link" data-token="{{item.token}}" bindtap="copy">复制查询码</text><text class="small-link" data-token="{{item.token}}" bindtap="forget">从本机移除</text></view></view><text class="small-link" bindtap="load">刷新进展</text></view>
